  "details": "Whenever the Index controllers turn themselves off after they have been left idle, when they are turned back on, the grey holograms in-game are permanently stuck on. The only way to resolve this currently is to restart the game.\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Load an instance\n2. Take off VR headset and controllers\n3. Wait until Index controllers turn themselves off\n4. Put the VR headset back on and turn on the controllers",
